// This file contains test cases that check for vim-surround |ys| behavior
// regarding word motions and text objects.
//
// Best viewed in Vim.

#V 5

#X i

// Basic word motions / text objects: w b e ge iw aw

B0 abc·|def·ghi·jkl␊
K yswb
B1 abc·|(def)·ghi·jkl␊

B0 abc·|def·ghi·jkl␊
K ysw)
B1 abc·|(def)·ghi·jkl␊

B0 abc·def·ghi·|jkl␊
K ysbb
B1 abc·def·|(ghi)·jkl␊

B0 abc·def·ghi·|jkl␊
K ysb)
B1 abc·def·|(ghi)·jkl␊

B0 abc·|def·ghi·jkl␊
K yseb
B1 abc·|(def)·ghi·jkl␊

B0 abc·|def·ghi·jkl␊
K yse)
B1 abc·|(def)·ghi·jkl␊

B0 abc·def·|ghi·jkl␊
K ysgeb
B1 abc·de|(f·g)hi·jkl␊

B0 abc·def·|ghi·jkl␊
K ysge)
B1 abc·de|(f·g)hi·jkl␊

B0 abc·def·g|hi·jkl␊
K ysiwb
B1 abc·def·|(ghi)·jkl␊

B0 abc·def·g|hi·jkl␊
K ysiw)
B1 abc·def·|(ghi)·jkl␊

// Visual state persistence

B0 zzz␊abc·|def·ghi·jkl␊
K gg0m<em> 2gg0fd
B1 zzz␊abc·|def·ghi·jkl␊
S1 '<=[0,1,1,0] '>=[0,1,3,0]

B0 zzz␊abc·|def·ghi·jkl␊
K gg0m<em> 2gg0fd yswb
B1 zzz␊abc·|(def)·ghi·jkl␊
S1 '<=[0,1,1,0] '>=[0,1,3,0]

B0 zzz␊abc·def·ghi·jkl␊
K gg0m<em> 2gg0fd ysiwb
B1 zzz␊abc·|(def)·ghi·jkl␊
S1 '<=[0,1,1,0] '>=[0,1,3,0]

// Motion failure

B0 abc·def·ghi·|jkl␊
K ys2aw)
B1 abc·def·ghi·jk|l␊
S1 visualmode()=
